graph TD
    A([🔐 Start: Log In to ERP Backend]) --> B{Authentication
Successful?}
    B -- No --> C[Display Error & Retry]
    C --> A
    B -- Yes --> D[(ERP DB: Load Admission
Pipeline Dashboard)]
    D --> E[View Kanban / List of
Pending Applications]
    E --> F[Select an Application
to Review]
    F --> G[(ERP DB: Fetch Full
Applicant Profile & Documents)]
    G --> H[View Applicant Details
OCR-Extracted Data & Raw Docs]
    H --> I{Need Docs
for Offline Review?}
    I -- Yes --> J[Download Document Package
PDF Bundle]
    J --> K[Conduct Offline Review]
    K --> H
    I -- No --> L{Sufficient Info
to Decide?}
    L -- No --> M[Flag Application:
Request Additional Information]
    M --> N[(ERP DB: Update Status to
'Pending Info' & Notify Candidate)]
    N --> E
    L -- Yes --> O{Admission
Decision}
    O -- Accept --> P[(ERP DB: Update Status to
'Accepted' & Trigger Offer Letter)]
    O -- Reject --> Q[(ERP DB: Update Status to
'Rejected' & Log Reason)]
    O -- Waitlist --> R[(ERP DB: Update Status to
'Waitlisted')]
    P --> S[Next Application in Queue?]
    Q --> S
    R --> S
    S -- Yes --> E
    S -- No --> T([✅ End: Pipeline Review Session Complete])